  <p> Portuguese population is feeling the impact of the crisis over fuel, and is fighting for a relief. Some argue that the profit margins of fuel companies should be lowered, others agree that the government should leave the charge, but all of them want the same thing. That the government think about themselves, at least once on their duty. </p>
